tion and to decide who is  going to speak on our behalf okay and  finally  if you could just paint a picture for us  on clearly this issue sort of resonates  amongst people living in namibia right  now  what are those issues just remind us  again and how far are you prepared to  take this  after the people were put into  concentration camps the german  government passed a number of ordinances  one of them being the expropriation of  land and livestock of our property we  were put into native reserves and we  continue to remain in those native  reserves  the purpose of these native reserves was  to keep us in poverty and this is where  we still remain and germany has got a  responsibility to do something about  this how far are we  willing to take this we are willing to  take both the namibian government to  court for violating our right of self  representation also doing things without  our free prior informed consent okay so  yes simulator thank you very much indeed  for speaking to dw news africa thank you
 

